  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_08_DataResidencyChallenge
  questionId: TECH-08
  category: 1
  speakerName: Principal Security Architect
  questionText: >-
    The customer challenges data residency and asks exactly what leaves their environment during analysis. How do you answer?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_08_A1
  answerText: >-
    Describe the data flow, retention controls, and exceptions, then offer to validate it against their legal requirements.
  technicalDelta: 3
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_08_A2
  answerText: >-
    Say compliance has approved this for many enterprise customers and move to the security benefits.
  technicalDelta: -1
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: -1
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_08_A3
  answerText: >-
    Admit you need to confirm edge cases, then list what you know and commit to a written architecture answer.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 0
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_08_A4
  answerText: >-
    Ask legal to join later and avoid specifics until the commercial team can frame the risk.
  technicalDelta: -2
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: -1
  energyDelta: -1
